# Fishing Register Project Rules

Follow [AGENTS.md](../AGENTS.md) and [docs/development-guidelines.md](../docs/development-guidelines.md).

## Must do

- Use `AppStartupService` for startup navigation decisions
- Use `DialogService` for Material dialogs
- Use repositories for IndexedDB access
- Use design tokens, not hardcoded colors (`#ff6b00`, `#1a1a1a`)
- Use `expandable-section` for collapsible UI
- Update `/docs` when changing subsystem behavior
- Use `MapsService` for external map links; validate coordinates
- Use `RodService` / event services for rod and bite logic
- Use `UserOptionService` and `option-combobox` for custom catch dropdowns
- Use `ResetService` with confirmation for all reset actions
- Follow [icons-and-fonts.mdc](./icons-and-fonts.mdc) for Material Icons, self-hosted fonts, and PWA/Capacitor SW rules
- Follow [button-style.mdc](./button-style.mdc) for action button shape (`--radius-button`) and Material variants

## Must not

- Scatter startup logic across components and guards
- Use `panelClass: 'dark-dialog'`
- Access Dexie `db` from feature components
- Store raw PIN values
- Create duplicate session or lock state
- Silently delete rod activity when reducing rod count
- Full reset without `RESET` confirmation token

## Testing

Add regression tests for bug fixes. Run `ng test` before completing work.
